    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d318">

                <pb facs="0639" n="515" xml:id="pg515"/>

                <head>No. 314.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Lowell</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 16,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have just sent full dispatch to Noyes respecting unfounded and injurious rumors
                    touching our pork product. Noyes will send copy to you. Make most diligent
                    effort to contradict rumors and counteract evil effect.</p>
                <closer><signed>BLAINE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
